        "notes": "**try to not sell any of the blues we already picked up, the purple we want can wait a round if need be but you should be able to get it**\n\nokay this is where we will try to buy our first purple, there are a few to choose from but i would highly recommend the  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) first as it will help us get our ult faster + it gives ap. if you are unable to get it and can only get blues i would recommend:\n\n-  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) \n-  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) \n-  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) \n\ni personally dont like [Levitation Shawl](item_7b951af4-eb03-4a51-96a0-409f373fb930) as it usually makes you an easier target to kill but if you really like it and can only get blues go for it, i just find it not useful and more detrimental.\n\nalso yes surprisingly we arent going for [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) yet as it doesnt really do much for us personally right now because the orbs we want to be throwing out are only healing ones and our ult, if we focus dmg, will kill through most if not all heals at this point.",
